spans.s:
कुतप^1 m. n. a blanket of goat-hair;
 m. Kuśa grass.
[1] Correction submitted by Jim Funderburk on 20160418. Reference: https://github.com/sanskrit-lexicon/CORRECTIONS/issues/289. note: alph. order, cf mw,pw.

कुतूहल n. the same (also w. प्रति or loc.);
 anything
curious, interesting, or amusing.

कु॑त्र (कु॑त्रा) adv. where? whither? on what account? for
what purpose? With चिद् & अपि indef. anywhere, somewhere. कुत्र चिद्
w. neg. nowhere;
 कुत्र चिद् — कुत्र चिद् here—there, sometimes —
sometimes;
 कुत्र—क्व = क्व—क्व.
